        <object id="scope" label="Boundary: planning and scheduling records do not prove approval or execution. Payroll supports labor; P2P supports component supply.&#10;The separate variance model is a proposed analytical review, not a stored approval gate. Completion does not wait for that review or for all cost-close work." bpmnType="heading">
